    cat <<'EOF'
Builds the moqui binary with cargo in this repo: target/release/moqui (cargo build --release -p
moqui), or target/debug/moqui with --debug. Other words go to cargo as they are. The tasks that run
moqui (run, load, test, save-db, ...) build the binary they need when it is not there.

A component in runtime/component with a Cargo.toml beside its component.xml is a Rust crate: the
build generates target/moqui-app, a crate that links those crates with the framework, and builds
