}

help_clean_all() {
    cat <<'EOF'
clean-db, clean-log, runtime/tmp, and tidy-cargo. tidy-cargo removes old cargo artifacts and keeps
the current debug and release builds. Saves in runtime/save are kept; delete those by hand.
